# Clean URLs are now native (each page lives at /<name>/index.html), so
# no rewrite rules are required for normal navigation. These redirects
# exist only to send old bookmarks/links at the previous /pages/*.html
# URLs to their new home, and are read automatically by hosts that
# support this file (e.g. Netlify). Safe to remove once nothing links
# to the old paths anymore.

